// Actions for the script-creation workbench.
//
// Data model: one `projects` row per script project (settings + outline +
// generated script JSON), `characters` rows for the cast (asset images in
// ctx.blobs), `scene_images` rows for uploaded scene references (blobs).
//
// Generation runs through ctx.inference with a strict Zod schema shaped
// like the user's 剧本格式01 layout. Timecodes are NOT generated by the
// model: the client recomputes them deterministically from each line's
// character count / speech rate, so in-page line edits re-time instantly.

